              When “Correct” Is Not Safe: Can We Trust Functionally Correct Patches Generated by Code Agents?
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        Corina Pasareanu
                      
